            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! Had trouble locating cream liqueur, so used coconut rum. Assume when I find the cream liqueur it'll be 5 Stars! What about cream or Half &amp; Half, or some such, instead of the milk?",
