            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Keeli"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a fun and unexpected combinations of ingredients that came together in a way I totally did not expect. I had some strawberry liquor I used instead of a syrup. It's like a grownup milkshake that's great on a warm afternoon.",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-28T13:03:23.650Z"
